    "How big the light is" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光源的大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to flare; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光源多亮才会产生眩光；接近 100 时只有最大最亮的点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to sparkle; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光源多亮才会产生闪光；接近 100 时只有最大最亮的点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the beams are" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光束的亮度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the lines are where the picture is black, so they show even over black" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图像为黑处线条的亮度，使其在黑底上也能显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How brightly lights open into discs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光点散成光盘的明亮程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "颜色与所选颜色相差多远仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the copies are" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各副本之间的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕线条的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个颜色通道（0–255）与点击颜色相差多少仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from each edge the sharpening reaches, in pixels." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "锐化距各边缘的延伸距离（像素）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from the light the beams reach" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光束从光源延伸的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in brightness the adjustment reaches." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整在亮度方向的影响范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in hue the adjustment reaches." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整在色相方向的影响范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in saturation the adjustment reaches." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整在饱和度方向的影响范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far into the scene the haze begins: low reaches up to the camera, high leaves all but the farthest parts clear" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "薄雾在场景中开始的位置：较低值一直延伸到相机跟前，较高值只覆盖最远处"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far out of focus: the size of each disc" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "失焦程度：每个光盘的大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模糊柔化的距离（像素）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "置换线条前亮度被平滑的程度：从尖锐山脊到圆润丘陵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the colors spread apart, red one way and blue the other" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "颜色分离的距离：红色一边，蓝色另一边"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the lens's coatings turn each streak blue along its length; none keeps the light's own color" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镜头镀膜使每条光斑沿长度变蓝的程度；0 保持光本身的颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light spreads" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光线扩散的范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light wraps around the subject's edges" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光线环绕主体边缘的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the spikes reach" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "尖峰延伸的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the streaks reach across the picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "条纹横跨画面的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How fine the detail it sharpens: small for crisp texture, larger for a punchier look" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "锐化的细节尺度：小值纹理清晰，大值更有冲击力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long each frame shows" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每帧显示的时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many pixels to expand, contract or feather the selection by" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "扩展、收缩或羽化选区的像素数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many spikes each light has, as the lens's aperture blades make them" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个光源的尖峰数，如镜头光圈叶片所形成的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times the picture echoes, each fainter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "画面重复的次数，每次更淡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much colored speckle is smoothed into the colors around it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "彩色噪点被平滑进周围颜色的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much fine texture and edges are kept while the grain is smoothed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "平滑颗粒时保留的细腻纹理和边缘程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much grain is smoothed from the picture's brightness" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从画面亮度中平滑掉的颗粒程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much light scatters: a soft halo around bright areas, and gently lifted shadows" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光的散射程度：亮部周围柔和光晕，阴影被轻轻提亮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个像素的误差扩散给相邻像素的程度。越低则色块越平"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "亮线填充间隙的程度；较暗部分画得更细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile distortion correction is applied." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配置文件扭曲校正的应用比例。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile vignetting correction is applied." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配置文件晕影校正的应用比例。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the beams break up into separate shafts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光束分离成独立光柱的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the curve also changes color strength. Zero matches Photoshop; lower keeps it to brightness, higher adds more color." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "曲线同时改变颜色强度的程度。0 与 Photoshop 一致；更低只影响亮度，更高加入更多颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How strongly edges and fine detail are brought out" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "边缘和细节被强化的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the light ends on the inside: low feathers it off softly from the edge, high holds it bright and ends it crisply" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光在内部的结束方式：低值从边缘柔和渐隐，高值保持明亮并干脆收尾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the line's ends, and each of its dashes and dots, are finished" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "线条端点以及每段虚线和点的收尾方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How thick the air is: haze lit by the light, thinner in front of the subject" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "空气浓度：被光照亮的雾，在主体前方较薄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How this line's ends are finished" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此线条端点的收尾方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
