    "Hue shifts the color, Saturation its strength, and Luminance its brightness." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“色相”改变颜色，“饱和度”改变强度，“明亮度”改变亮度。"
