          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本框保留标准 macOS 编辑按键。对话框共用上方“应用/取消”的快捷键设置。数字输入框使用 Up/Down 键，按住 Shift 步进更大。标准 macOS 命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本框保留标准 macOS 编辑键。对话框共用上面的“应用/取消”设置。数字输入框用上/下箭头，配合 Shift 步进更大。标准 macOS 命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。快捷键编辑器本身在未录制时始终用 Return 保存、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text · Double-click to edit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本 · 双击编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本编辑快捷键需要 Command、Option 或 Control，以免替代正常输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Texture" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "纹理"
