            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取该 Photoshop 文件，可能已损坏或不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop stroke isn’t supported on shape layers and was omitted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
